  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/wt0KIlE.png\" alt=\"TerraFirmaPunk\" width=\"1200\" height=\"571\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>將<strong>蒸氣龐克</strong>的世界引入這款硬核生存模組，讓遊戲變得更具挑戰性！</div><div><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><u>歡迎來到<strong>TerraFirmaPunk</strong>！</u></span></div><div>探索古老文明的廢墟，學習掌握蒸氣之力，同時在飢餓、脫水、致命洞穴、危險生物、殭屍大軍和邪惡頭目怪物的環伺下求生。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>更多細節請參閱 TFC 論壇的討論串：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f8021-tfc-07915-terrafirmapunk-hqm-steampunk-adventures%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此</a>：</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong><span style=\"font-size:x-large\">TerraFirmaPunk 2.0：</span></strong></div><div><strong><span style=\"font-size:x-large\">&nbsp;</span></strong></div><div>包含的模組：</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f8687-tfc-07924-animal-crate%252f%253fp%253d112909\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Animal Crate</a> by TaeoG</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1292324-1-7-2-1-6-4-1-5-2-forge-antique-atlas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Antique Atlas</a> by Hunternif</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1289952-archimedes-ships-v1-7-banking-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Archimedes' Ships</a> by BalkondeurAlpha</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/1114612-164-bspkrs-mods-armorstatushud-directionhud-statuseffecthud/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ArmorStatusHUD</a> by bspkrs</div><div><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/autorun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoRun</a> by mysticdrew</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fichun.us%252fmods%252fback-tools%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back Tools</a> by iChun</div><div><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/230898-better-boat\