ndrous Steam Power Mod</a> by Flaxbeard</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.railcraft.info%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Railcraft</a> by CovertJaguar</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1289551-1-6-x-1-7-2-1-7-10-random-things-2-0-remake\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Random Things</a> by Lumien</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1290238-roguelike-dungeons-v1-3-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roguelike Dungeons</a> by Greymerk</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1275007-1-7-10-ropes-now-with-hookshot-and-3d-ziplines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ropes+</a> by AtomicStryker</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1282339-ruins-structure-spawning-system\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ruins</a> by AtomicStryker</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1274224-smart-moving\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smart Moving</a> by Divisor</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2158080-sound-filters-a-client-side-mod-adds-reverb-to\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Filters</a> by Tmtravlr</div><div><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/224017-steamcraft-2-beta-2-fluxian-storm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SteamCraft 2</a> by warlordjones, ClockworkKaiser, decebaldecebal, domi1819</div><div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2198533-storage-drawers-updated-sep-01-14\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers</a> by jaquadro</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f7850-tfc-07915-streams-real-flowing-rivers%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Streams</a> by delvr</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252findex.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraft</a> by bioxx</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f6733-171079-terrafirmacraft-nei-plugin%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraftNEIplugin</a> by dries007</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.feed-the-beast.com%252fNo%2blink\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaPunk Tweaks</a> by JAWolfe, OneWolfe</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f9153-07928-terrafirmastuff%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaStuff</a> by Bunsan</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f8401-tfc-07926091terramisc-revamped-recipes%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraMisc</a> by Powerman913717</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f8498-tfc-07923-tfc-additions-103%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFC Additions</a> by raymondbh</div><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f8288-tfc-07925-tfcrailcraft%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFC 鐵路兼容</a> 作者：Vidaj</div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f7587-tfc-7913-galenalimonite-extraction-mod%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFC 礦物提取模組</a> 作者：Bletch</div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f8020-tfc-07916-tfc-water-compatibility-with-other-mods%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFC 水源兼容性</a> 作者：vidaj</div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fterrafirmacraft.com%252ff%252ftopic%252f8578-tfc-07926-tfc-tweaks-unifies-water-auto-food-merge-on-pickup%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFC 調整模組</a> 作者：dries007</div>\n<div><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tfctech-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFCTech 附加組件</a> 作者：Shurgent</div>\n<div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/561673-164-the-twilight-forest-v1203-haunting-of-the-knight-phantoms/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林</a> 作者：Benimatic</div>\n<div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/1846244-172-waila-145/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waila</a> 作者：ProfMobius</div>\n<div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1295067-waila-harvestability-how-can-i-harvest-what-im\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waila 可採集性</a> 作者：squeek502</div>\n<div><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2169830-wawla-what-are-we-looking-at\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawla</a> 作者：Darkhax</div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fcoros.us%252fmods%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍感知模組</a> 作者：Corosauce</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>版本 / 更新日誌：</strong></div>\n<div><strong>1.0.90 - 1.0.99</strong> 這些是在1.0至2.0之間逐步開發的測試版本。這些版本均存在大量錯誤，並可能在不久的將來被移除。</div>\n<div><strong>2.0</strong> 2.0版本是對1.0的全面重寫，無法直接從1.0簡單更新！</div>\n<div><strong>以下是2.0版本新增的主要功能：</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<ul>\n<li>任務書已完全重寫，變得更為精簡，並更好地融入TFC的世界。</li>\n<li>科技樹已全面重構，呈現類似核心TFC合金階段的線性進展。</li>\n<li>機械與技術配方高度整合，經常需要其他機械才能進行製作。</li>\n<li>許多非TFC的機械零件（如BuildCraft齒輪）現在可以在TFC的鐵砧上鍛造。</li>\n<li>怪物現在擁有獨特的行為模式和棲息地。掌握這些習性將是您生存與發展的關鍵！</li>\n<li>部分生態域將比其他區域更加危險且回報豐厚！</li>\n<li>失落的遺跡、地牢和洞穴對毫無準備的探險者來說極度致命，但對裝備精良的探險隊伍而言卻充滿寶藏。越深入地下，怪物越危險！</li>\n<li>透過本版本新增的科技模組組合，可以實現因式分解與自動化，這將是終局目標的重要組成部分。</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
